<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador is seeing a wave of high-profile violence and prosecutions: seven individuals have been summoned to stand trial for plotting to murder a candidate, and U.S. authorities have charged the son of former President and four others with cocaine trafficking. A priest was killed when a crucifix fell from a church wall in the Galapagos. President Daniel Noboa continues to detain opposition leader Luisa González on money-laundering charges, reflecting the broader security crisis that began in 2018. The crisis recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQUHczLURZd0tVNmk0WGFNVmlzaEk1WGtzSW1SVk5fbXM1dndBalZzOXJLZEdRN2o4clBHTEdqVmZvUFZ0d2hibEJZaDVtZzNVMGZkVm9tSy0wWmd1ZVBWRktSMFc5TGFWejZsMWxXUDhmMDVGOHhEM0RtZjZMcjZJbjV5bldjeDhIdlRLX09yeWZHQTU2bzliMDRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;News-Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNYkVpem9sWVpPTE1faWI3T0NBMU5ic0M2QjVhWS1FcGVxc0l2UzF0LUhUdmhwVlBMZGlaWGZ0QUJwNVQ4SklQOTRfR0hTdkhrVzdqQlptQzY1WUgzMXp6bkJlZ0Q5Z1JPN292NS03blJmZkZUOFJjSVRqM2tpcGRlQ0RQZXg5bE1naTZnUENSZHo3YkdWV0kyRFp3bVgyOTZnaG1PbTRDbGxiUmxOUVMxaDIxU0JHZkVGVmtQQUNR?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSLS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOdGNGcTRHbUl1T1pickNaQmNfaUxlNk85R1ZYN3JFQk1FNFF4T01JcUtlZjAzUHg2QmtzT0FzS1I4b2xxVTVhcTFicWtkcjdRN0RuQkxESndUdFRfSXdLSlh5R2M5dmh3RU5POGd5dnZ6ZXNWeVY4QzRxTGNNQ1JkeU1n?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tacoma News Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE44M3ZNM2R4anJvMEswM2RsMlNxeFdLbkZaTVBrNTU2X1dPbEJqWk9ZUGc2eXdnRVRBWEhYSzdFbVZpSVhxMjlkQXpHbjBQLXE5UnpJZlMzUVIyM1RxMllZ0gFcQVVfeXFMUDJuTmJ6R1lpd1V3aHgwYThJYjVyVWNZNzNneG83ZFhCdTlaM3hhdHZWWXl6RGZpLVhsSW1qTVRmd2FDTkY4c2RoczliTTZGQVEyY1JMdEt3cnZqQ1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Moder